00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:24.733
- I'm in, I wanna be on a
private jet, yes, please.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.733
Anyone else?

00:00:26.763 --> 00:00:31.143
- I think Meredith is
working with AA people.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.401
